<% content_for :title, "Support — Tondo" %>
<% content_for :description, "How to reach a person about Tondo." %>

<%# `here: nil`, same contract as the privacy page. %>
<%= render "shared/masthead", label: "Support", here: nil %>

<main class="page">
  <article class="doc">
    <p class="doc__lead">
      Tondo is made by one person. Write to
      <%= mail_to "support@dailytondo.com", class: "doc__link" %> and that person
      reads it.
    </p>

    <div class="ornament" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>

    <h2 class="doc__head">What Tondo is</h2>

    <p>One artwork a day, drawn from the open-access collections of the
    Metropolitan Museum of Art, the Art Institute of Chicago, the Cleveland
    Museum of Art, and the Minneapolis Institute of Art. Every work is public
    domain. The app is free, carries no advertising, and paywalls nothing.</p>

    <div class="ornament" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>

    <h2 class="doc__head">Things people ask</h2>

    <p><strong>Do I need an account?</strong> No. The app works without one, and
    works you keep are stored on your device. Signing in with Google or Apple
    moves your collection to an account so it survives a new phone.</p>

    <p><strong>How do I delete what you have?</strong> Open <em>Your corner</em>
    — the ◎ mark at the top of every screen. There is a delete control there for
    your account or for this device, whichever you have. Details are on the
    <%= link_to "privacy page", privacy_path, class: "doc__link" %>.</p>

    <p><strong>An artwork looks wrong, or the note has an error.</strong> Please
    write. Say which day it was and what you saw. Museum catalogue records
    occasionally carry mistakes and we would rather fix ours than keep them.</p>

    <p><strong>Can I suggest a work?</strong> Yes. That is the most useful mail
    this address gets.</p>

    <div class="ornament" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>

    <h2 class="doc__head">If something is broken</h2>

    <p>Tell us what you tapped, what happened, and what you expected instead. If
    it is visual, a screenshot settles it faster than a paragraph. There is no
    ticket system and no automated reply; you will hear back from a person.</p>
  </article>

  <footer class="coda">
    <div class="ornament" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
    <%= link_to "Privacy", privacy_path, class: "caps-link" %>
  </footer>
</main>
